<title>USA: Scitex Q3 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Scitex Q3 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(U.S. Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			     Nine months ended   Quarter Ended</p>
<p>				    Sept. 30,	   Sept 30,</p>
<p>				   1996	1995     1996	1995</p>
<p> Total revenues	    526,591  538,250   141,900   184,568</p>
<p> Restructuring costs	56,100   18,000    56,100    18,000</p>
<p> Operating loss	  (159,136) (35,742) (152,126)  (32,472)</p>
<p>Share in income</p>
<p>(losses) of equity</p>
<p>  investments		    560    (781)	  85     (466)</p>
