<p> Loss per share	     (3.59)   (0.43)    (3.53)    (0.85)</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     42,809   42,798    42,809    42,807</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 net inlcudes $54 million charge related to receivables, inventory and other matters.</p>
<p>Company reported earnings late Thursday, after the market closed.</p>
